    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Supernatural Gift (Charm)</em></p><p>This Charm allows you to give yourself the benefit of a @UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.equipment.Item.dmgPotionOfHeroi]{Potion of Heroism} as a Magic action. Once you do so, the Charm vanishes from you.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-VSchHVg4E8Vu1j9s\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Use Charm</strong> activity includes a healing option for the 10 Temporary Hit Points and an Active Effect that automates the effects of Bless.</p></section>",
